1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,871
MIDI-GPT works in whole bars.

2
00:00:04,071 --> 00:00:08,729
The time selection is what
the model reads as context.

3
00:00:08,929 --> 00:00:12,943
The selected MIDI items
are what it rewrites.

4
00:00:13,143 --> 00:00:19,157
Here: bars 1–8 as context, and the
bass in bars 5–6 as the part to write.

5
00:00:19,357 --> 00:00:21,371
Click "Generate".

6
00:00:23,571 --> 00:00:28,800
The Information tab shows the
progress while the model writes.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,657
The new bars are written
straight into the bass track.

8
00:00:40,857 --> 00:00:45,657
Not what you wanted? Undo it
(Cmd/Ctrl+Z) and try again.
